==Event Information==
A new Angel threat arrives in the Cat Empire! The {{Color|#FF0000|'''EVANGELION'''}} and Battle Cats Crossover Event is back!<br>
{{Color|#E500FF|'''Available July 31st (11am) through August 14th, 2023 (10:59)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Evangelion Collab Capsules, with a new series of Ubers!'''}}<br>
Collect special Battle Cats versions of your favorite Evangelion characters in TWO special crossover Rare Capsule sets!<br>
Along with all the powerful returning units only available during this collab event, this newest edition includes the brand new Uber Rare set {{Color|#0000FF|'''Evangelion 2nd Strike'''}}! Plus, new Rare Units {{Color|#FF0000|'''One-Eyed Asuka'''}} and {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Eva Unit-13'''}} are available to collect from both the original Evangelion Collab Capsules and Evangelion 2nd Strike sets!<br>
Plus, {{Color|#993366|'''Eva Unit-01'''}}, {{Color|#34A853|'''AAA Wunder'''}}, and {{Color|#3366FF|'''Rei Ayanami'''}} have been given all new True Forms!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Limited Units available in the Evangelion Collab Capsule set include:'''}}<br>
[[EVA Unit-08 (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Eva Unit-08 (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Long-range Area Attacks have a chance to knockback, freeze and weaken Floating enemies, and deliver extra damage to Eva Angel type enemies while taking less damage from them!<br>
[[AAA Wunder (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008F03|'''AAA Wunder (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks deliver massive damage to Angels and Zombies!<br>
[[EVA Unit-00 (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#0000FF|'''Eva Unit-00 (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Tough vs Angels & Floating, and negates Wave attacks! Area attacks gain increased damage and defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[EVA Unit-01 (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#993366|'''Eva Unit-01 (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong versus Alien & Zombie enemies! Area attacks power up as it takes damage, and destroys Barriers! Increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels, and stops Zombies from reviving!<br>
[[EVA Unit-02 (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Eva Unit-02 (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Long-Range Area strikes and massive damage vs Red enemies!<br>
Plus, has increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[Shinji Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#00BAFF|'''Shinji Cat (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Knocks back Metal & Black with area-effect Wave Attacks!<br>
[[Moon Operators (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#34A853|'''Moon Operators (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks slow Red & Zombies! Plus, kills Zombies permanently and prevents them from reviving!<br>
[[One-Eyed Asuka (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''One-Eyed Asuka'''}}]]<br>
Long-range Area Surge attacks have 100% Curse against her enemies! Features increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels, along with Colossus Slayer!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Limited Units available in the Evangelion 2nd Strike capsule set include:'''}}<br>
[[Night Oracle Rei (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Night Oracle Rei (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Tough vs Traited enemies, with Surge attacks and 100% Slow. Plus, extra attack damage and tougher defense vs Eva Angels!<br>
[[The 4th Angel (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008F03|'''The 4th Angel (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks deliver massive damage & have Knockback vs Black enemies.<br>
[[The 6th Angel (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#0000FF|'''The 6th Angel (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Massive Long-Range Area damage & Slow vs Floating enemies, with Surge attacks too!<br>
[[The 9th Angel (Uber Rare Cat)|'''The 9th Angel (Uber Rare)''']]<br>
Long-range Area Damage & Weaken vs Alien enemies, with Surge attacks too!<br>
[[The 10th Angel (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''The 10th Angel (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Massive Omnistrike Damage & Freeze vs Angelic enemies, plus Surge attacks!<br>
[[EVA Unit-13 (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#0000FF|'''Eva Unit-13'''}}]]<br>
Strong against Aku, with Mini-Surge! Plus, extra attack damage and tougher defense vs Eva Angels!<br>
{{Color|#00BAFF|'''Plus, Rare and Super Rare units available from both sets:'''}}<br>
[[Rei Ayanami (???) (Super Rare Cat)|'''Rei Ayanami (???) (Super Rare)''']]<br>
Tough vs Black enemies, with a chance to Weaken them!<br>
Delivers extra damage to Eva Angel enemies, while taking less damage from them!<br>
[[Misato Katsuragi (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Misato Katsuragi (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks have a chance to break barriers and Slow Aliens!<br>
[[Ritsuko Akagi (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#AA33CC|'''Ritsuko Akagi (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks have a chance to weaken Aliens!<br>
[[Rei Ayanami (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Rei Ayanami (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks might weaken Angels!<br>
Plus, has increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[Asuka Langley (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Asuka Langley (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong vs. Red Enemies, with Area Attack!<br>
Plus, has increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[Mari Illustrious (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#34A853|'''Mari Illustrious (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong vs. Floating, with Area Attack!<br>
Plus, has increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
'''[[Kaworu Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|Kaworu Cat}}]] <font color="#FF0000">|</font> [[Rei Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|Rei Cat}}]] <font color="#FF0000">|</font> [[Asuka Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|Asuka Cat}}]] <font color="#FF0000">|</font> [[Mari Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|Mari Cat (Rare)}}]]'''<br>
Awesome limited edition Rare Cat versions of the Evangelion heroes!

※ During the crossover campaign period, you will have a set chance to collect one of the Evangelion collab units from the Evangelion / Evangelion 2nd Strike capsule sets. Evangelion / Evangelion 2nd Strike units can not be collected from other Rare Capsule sets. If you wish to draw collab units, please make sure that you have selected the Evangelion or Evangelion 2nd Strike capsule set by tapping the icon at the top of the Rare Capsule Machine page.<br>
※If Evangelion Collab Capsules fail to appear in the Rare Capsule Machine, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version.

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Evangelion Collab Stages appear in The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
Evangelion characters appear as foes in these dangerous stages! Prepare units with the {{Color|#00BAFF|'''Eva Angel Killer'''}} effect and {{Color|#0000FF|'''increase your units' effectiveness'''}} with the skill before diving in!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''All stage rewards have been reset'''}}, and {{Color|#0000FF|'''new stages have also been added'''}}!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Limited Stages "Evangelion Activates" & "Decisive Battle!"'''}}<br>
Visit the Stories of Legend/Event Stages during this collaboration to test your Cats at Evangelion collab stages!<br>
Clear the {{Color|#00BAFF|'''"Evangelion Activates!"'''}} stage for a change to receive the collab unit [[Shinji & Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Shinji & Cat!'''}}]]!<br>
Higher-difficulty stages will on this map will have a higher chance to unlock Shinji & Cat! (Or you can use a Treasure Radar for a guaranteed chance to receive this character!)<br>
Clearing {{Color|#00BAFF|'''"Decisive Battle!"'''}} will earn you huge XP rewards!<br>
※Activate Shinji & Cat by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※Players who have already collected Shinji & Cat from a previous collab event will not be able to receive it again.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Defend Tokyo-3 Against the Angel menace!'''}}<br>
The collab map {{Color|#00BAFF|'''"The 9th Angel Strikes!"'''}} with extra-tough stages will be available at the times listed below! Can you smash the cruel Angels and hold off Third Impact?

*Odd Dates (7/31、8/1、8/3、8/5、8/7、8/9、8/11、8/13)
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''12:00pm～1:59pm / 9:00pm～10:59pm'''}}
*Even Dates (8/2、8/4、8/6、8/8、8/10、8/12)
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00am～8:59am / 5:00pm～6:59pm'''}}
*Last Collab Date (8/14)
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00am～10:59am'''}}

Clearing these stages will give you a chance to collect the limited edition collab character [[Giraffe Unit-01 (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Giraffe Unit-01'''}}]]!<br>
Higher-difficulty stages will on this map will have a higher chance to unlock Giraffe Unit-01! (Or you can use a Treasure Radar for a guaranteed chance to receive this character!)

※If Collab Stages fail to appear, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version<br>
※Players who have already collected Giraffe Unit-01 from a previous collab event will not be able to receive it again.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Challenge the Ultimate Refusal Type Angel!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''5 days from the start of the collab'''}}, collab map {{Color|#00BAFF|'''"The 10th Angel Strikes!"'''}} will be available at the times listed below!

*Odd Dates  (8/5、8/7、8/9、8/11、8/13)
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00am～8:59am / 5:00pm～6:59pm'''}}
*Even Dates (8/4、8/6、8/8、8/10、8/12)
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''12:00pm～1:59pm / 9:00pm～10:59pm'''}}
*Last Collab Date (8/14)
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00am～10:59am'''}}

Clearing these stages will give you a chance to collect the True Form of limited edition collab character {{Color|#FF6D01|'''Kaworu & Cat'''}}! Can you conquer these super-tough stages and pick up Kaworu's 3rd form?

※Upgrade Kaworu & Cat to level 20 to unlock its True Form.<br>
※Higher-difficulty stages will on this map will have a higher chance to unlock Kaworu & Cat's True Form!<br>
※Treasure Radar may be used on any stage for a guaranteed chance to receive Kaworu & Cat's True Form.<br>
※Players who have already collected Kaworu & Cat's True Form from a previous collab event will not be able to unlock it again.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Defeat a relentless gauntlet of Angels in collab-only challenge stage!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''From Day 5 of the collab (8/4/2023) at 11:00am'''}}, visit the Event/Legend Stages to challenge the collab gauntlet map {{Color|#00BAFF|Heralds of the End}}!<br>
Heralds of the End can be challenged after clearing {{Color|#3366FF|'''Evangelion Activates'''}}, {{Color|#3366FF|'''Decisive Battle'''}}, {{Color|#3366FF|'''The 9th Angel Strikes'''}}, and {{Color|#3366FF|'''The 10th Angel Strikes'''}}.

Can you defeat a weird and terrifying parade of Eva Angels and reach Level 20? Each stage cleared will unlock the next, tougher stage with even more rewards!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・A weapon that should not exist! Face down the terrifying Unit-13!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''After Day 7 of the collab (8/6/2023) at 11:00am'''}}, collab map {{Color|#00BAFF|'''"Unit-13 Strikes!"'''}} will be available at the times listed below!

・Odd Dates (8/7、8/9、8/11、8/13)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''12:00pm～1:59pm / 7:00pm～8:59pm'''}}<br>
・Even Dates (8/6、8/8、8/10、8/12)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''9:00am～10:59am / 9:00pm～10:59pm'''}}<br>
・Last Collab Date (8/14)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00am～10:59am'''}}

Clear the stage for a chance to unlock {{Color|#FF00FF|Shinji ＆ Cat's True Form!}}<br>
Plus, collect a {{Color|#FF00FF|30 Cat Food reward the first time you clear the final stage}} in the map!<br>

※ Upgrade Shinji & Cat to level 20 to unlock its True Form.<br>
※ Shinji & Cat can be collected from the "Evangelion Activates!" stage.<br>
※ Higher-difficulty stages will on this map will have a higher chance to unlock Shinji & Cat's True Form!<br>
※ Treasure Radar may be used on any stage for a guaranteed chance to receive Shinji & Cat's True Form.

・{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Challenge the Eva piloted by Gendo Ikari, Unit 13!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''From Day 9 of the collab at 11:00am'''}}, collab map {{Color|#00BAFF|'''"'''}}{{Color|#33CCCC|'''Final Battle: EVA Unit-13'''}}{{Color|#00BAFF|'''"'''}} will be available! Clear this stage to earn Cat Tickets and Catseyes!<br>
Prepare yourselves ofr the final battle with Gendo!

・{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Challenge the new stage Bye-bye, all of the Cats!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''From Day 11 of the collab at 11:00am'''}}, collab map {{Color|#00BAFF|'''"Bye-bye, all of the Cats"'''}} will be available! Clear this stage to earn 1 Rare Ticket!<br>
Team up with your Cats to create a world where Eva pilots are no longer needed!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limited Gamatoto Expedition Areas!'''}}<br>
Evangelion themed Gamatoto areas {{Color|#FF0000|NERV HQ}} ({{Color|#FF00FF|'''July 31st (11:00) until August 6th (10:59)'''}}) and Near Third Impact ({{Color|#FF00FF|'''August 6th (11:00) until August 14th (10:59)'''}}) will be available only during this collaboration event!<br>
Don't miss out on bonus rewards - send your Gamatoto gang to these special stages before they disappear!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Special collab missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Take on Special Mission challenges and earn delightful bonus rewards by playing limited-time-only Evangelion events!<br>
※Evangelion Special Missions will only appear in the Catnip Challenges until August 14th, 2021 at 11am. You must accept all rewards before the mission disappears at the end of the Catnip Challenges event!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Login each day for stamp rewards and a limited edition Cat Unit !'''}}<br>
Awesome login bonuses, available to collect only during this collab event!<br>
Visit The Battle Cats each day during this collab campaign to pick up every stamp and get a Rare Ticket, battle items and other rewards! Plus, your fifth Login Stamp will unlock the Special Collab Unit "[[Gendo & Fuyutsuki Cats (Special Cat)|{{Color|#34A853|Gendo & Fuyutsuki Cats}}]]"<br>
Don't forget to login or you'll miss out!<br>

※Once received, you can unlock "Gendo & Fuyutsuki Cats" by visiting the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※Players who have already collected Gendo & Fuyutsuki Cat's True Form from a previous collab event will not be able to unlock it again.

